{"spread": 29, "blocks": [[{"t": "The Engineer\u2019s Toolbox in Heritage ", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 22.7, "color": "#4CBC8E", "bbox": [266, 92, 624, 122]}, {"t": "Projects", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 22.7, "color": "#4CBC8E", "bbox": [266, 119, 351, 150]}], [{"t": "Working alongside main contractor TCG Construction at Cross ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 12.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [266, 159, 627, 176]}, {"t": "Street, our team saw first-hand how heritage constraints test ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 12.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [266, 173, 628, 190]}, {"t": "both planning and execution. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 12.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [266, 188, 440, 204]}], [{"t": "\u2022\t", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Bold", "size": 12.0, "color": "#4CBC8E", "bbox": [266, 216, 274, 233]}, {"t": "Low headroom", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Bold", "size": 12.0, "color": "#4CBC8E", "bbox": [284, 216, 369, 233]}, {"t": " and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 12.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [369, 217, 397, 233]}, {"t": "tight cavities", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Bold", "size": 12.0, "color": "#4CBC8E", "bbox": [397, 216, 474, 233]}, {"t": " meant conventional ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 12.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [474, 217, 596, 233]}, {"t": "layouts were off the table. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 12.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [284, 231, 441, 248]}, {"t": "\u2022\t", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Bold", "size": 12.0, "color": "#4CBC8E", "bbox": [266, 245, 274, 262]}, {"t": "Specialised equipment", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Bold", "size": 12.0, "color": "#4CBC8E", "bbox": [284, 245, 416, 262]}, {"t": " was chosen to fit where standard ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 12.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [416, 245, 618, 262]}, {"t": "kit could not. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 12.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [284, 260, 364, 276]}, {"t": "\u2022\t", "font": "SpaceGr